[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3911032967","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116384#issuecomment-3911032967","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116384","id":3911032967,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pHaCH","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T23:52:54Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T00:14:48Z","body":"I debugged a bit and found out the following:\n- `background-comp-level-8-works.webp`\n<img width=\"551\" height=\"169\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e3e922c-09d8-4a00-b998-714e0f3231fe\" />\n\nCorrectly detects, that the WebP is lossless (format=2) and has no animation.\n\nUsing the `webpinfo` binary:\n```\nFile: background-comp-level-8-works.webp\nRIFF HEADER:\n  File size:   1766\nChunk VP8L at offset     12, length   1754\n  Width: 2048\n  Height: 512\n  Alpha: 1\n  Animation: 0\n  Format: Lossless (2)\nNo error detected.\n```\n\n- `background-comp-level-9-dont.webp`\n<img width=\"594\" height=\"194\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1253138a-9e02-4784-a8a7-cd9984255f18\" />\n\nSame image, I just changed the compression level. Now it detects the WebP format as undefined/mixed (format=0) and with an animation (There is none).\n\nUsing the `webpinfo` binary:\n```\nFile: background-comp-level-9-dont.webp\nRIFF HEADER:\n  File size:   1654\nChunk VP8X at offset     12, length     18\n  ICCP: 0\n  Alpha: 1\n  EXIF: 0\n  XMP: 0\n  Animation: 1\n  Canvas size 2048 x 512\nChunk ANIM at offset     30, length     14\n  Background color:(ARGB) ff ff ff ff\n  Loop count      : 1\nChunk ANMF at offset     44, length   1610\n  Offset_X: 0\n  Offset_Y: 110\n  Width: 2048\n  Height: 402\n  Duration: 1\n  Dispose: 0\n  Blend: 1\nChunk VP8L at offset     68, length   1586\n  Width: 2048\n  Height: 402\n  Alpha: 1\n  Animation: 0\n  Format: Lossless (2)\nNo error detected.\n```\n\nIt seems to use the first VP8X chunk information, which are not right.\n\nI wonder why this happens. But also why all other programs can handle that still. So there must be a combination which we do not handle yet correctly in Godot?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3911032967/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3914398510","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116384#issuecomment-3914398510","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116384","id":3914398510,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pUPsu","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T12:17:54Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T12:17:54Z","body":"Sounds like:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109558","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3914398510/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3915276059","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116384#issuecomment-3915276059","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116384","id":3915276059,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pXl8b","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T15:09:21Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T15:09:21Z","body":"Indeed, I also found the issue while searching. But it is not related to Krita. And the WebP file itself is fine. So I made a new issue, but we could consolidate!\n\nChecking the source code from aseprite, it does import the WebP frame by frame, which seems to work just fine and is probably why Godot can not handle that, as we do not do that.\n\nAs to why the file looks like this: My guess is that the higher compression levels tend to creates a 'mixed' WebP with the chunks to further optimize size. \n\nThis seems to happen only for big sprites, probably with a high amount of transparency (or another fill color). For reference, in another Game I have > 100 lossless WebP files with the highest compression, but I never had this problem. All those Sprites are small and Pixel Art, so there is always a small amount of colors used.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3915276059/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4310092512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116384#issuecomment-4310092512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116384","id":4310092512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAObK4A","user":{"login":"OliverWangData","id":48231880,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MjMxODgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48231880?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverWangData","html_url":"https://github.com/OliverWangData","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverWangData/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverWangData/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverWangData/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverWangData/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverWangData/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverWangData/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverWangData/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverWangData/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverWangData/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-24T02:24:26Z","updated_at":"2026-04-24T02:24:26Z","body":"I'm encountering this in 4.6.1. Not directly related to krita as I don't use krita, my texture is created using texture packer. The failure seems to be non deterministic, sometimes I run my game and I get\n\n```\nE 0:00:00:674   _webp_unpack: Failed decoding WebP image.\n  <C++ Error>   Condition \"errdec\" is true. Returning: Ref<Image>()\n  <C++ Source>  modules/webp/webp_common.cpp:147 @ _webp_unpack()\n```\n\nOther times it runs fine. If I run into the error once it seems to happen back to back multiple times often (not always). \n\nThe texture is very large (8192x12288) and is full of transparency as its a cutout sprite sheet. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4310092512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]